{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31361","headline":"奉酬绵州中丞以江山小图远垂赐及兼寄诗 · 李朋","name":"奉酬绵州中丞以江山小图远垂赐及兼寄诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巴江与雪山，井邑共回环。\n图写丹青内，分明烟霭间。\n移君名郡兴，助我小斋闲。\n日想登临处，高踪不可攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李朋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}